# Cloudflare Pages Redirects
# Enforce HTTPS and non-www canonical domain

# www to non-www (HTTPS)
https://www.luxht.com/* https://luxht.com/:splat 301

# www to non-www (HTTP)  
http://www.luxht.com/* https://luxht.com/:splat 301

# HTTP to HTTPS (non-www)
http://luxht.com/* https://luxht.com/:splat 301
